            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hmmm... Even with [nvim-telescope/telescope-ui-select.nvim](https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope-ui-select.nvim) I can not reproduce this.\r\nEverything is pointing to the \"buffer 44\" being from Telescope, but for me it still works. Could you execute `:buffers!` when Telescope prompt is visible? Type `<Esc>` to go in Normal mode, execute `:buffers!`, see which buffers are latest, try reading session. If error is shown, match buffer from error message to previous `:buffers!` output.\r\n\r\nBy the way, is this error from reading and writing always the same session? Maybe something is wrong with session file itself?",
