            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Issue seems to have been resolved! Thanks!\r\n\r\nFinally! That is great to hear :)\r\n\r\nOther issue is a #57. About when it appears... 'mini.starter' [uses `MiniSessions.read()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/fe764ecba07b16ea8c02cbd22bc467afbee399f2/lua/mini/starter.lua#L465) and `MiniSessions.read()` [uses `source`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/fe764ecba07b16ea8c02cbd22bc467afbee399f2/lua/mini/sessions.lua#L194). At the moment I still lack the reproducible example and think that it is an issue in Vim itself (maybe how it handles restoring folds for files that changed outside of the session in question).\r\n\r\nClosing this one then.",
